Two-panel UMAP scatter plot comparing cell-type labels for single-cell data: left panel labeled “Truth” and right panel labeled “Predicted.” Both panels have axes “Umap 1” and “Umap 2” and show similarly arranged colored clusters. The legend lists B cells, CD4 T cells, CD8 T cells, CD14+ Monocytes, Dendritic Cells, FCGR3A+ Monocytes, Megakaryocytes, and NK cells. The figure shows predicted cell-type assignments closely matching the ground-truth labels, with major clusters aligned across panels.
Figure 8: UMAP plot of embeddings from LangCell [12] for PBMC-10K [56] dataset in zero-shot task. Plots are colored by actual cell type labels and predicted cell type labels.

SCIENTIFIC_FIGURE

